# Runtime-generated gate config: load_config() recreates this wherever the process cwd happens
# to be when HOUDINI_USER_PREF_DIR is unset (e.g. a test run). Machine-specific, and a stray copy
# in the repo could later be mistaken for real gate configuration.
mcp_gate/
